WEBVTT

00:00:21.721 --> 00:00:24.491
Let's go and don't cry, funny

00:00:24.491 --> 00:00:27.427
Give me a dumbass dream, please

00:00:27.427 --> 00:00:29.663
Don't touch me, baby

00:00:29.663 --> 00:00:32.866
Freedom, baby

00:00:32.866 --> 00:00:38.772
I'm elastic, I want to be chained

00:00:38.772 --> 00:00:43.376
Can you feel it? The nonsensical afterimage

00:00:43.376 --> 00:00:55.121
Even the moments of points and lines
disappear after failing to show

00:00:55.121 --> 00:01:00.861
The sad forefront, an empty sensation

00:01:00.861 --> 00:01:06.533
Sweet remnants that tear at my heart

00:01:06.533 --> 00:01:12.205
Scattering Polaroids, gathering paranoia

00:01:12.205 --> 00:01:17.377
I want you to tell me whose turn is next

00:01:17.377 --> 00:01:30.745
If you sleep close to this incomplete
form, you'll understand and see

00:01:34.094 --> 00:01:37.664
Investigate every place where
Gerd Frentzen might hide out.

00:01:37.664 --> 00:01:39.599
We can't let him run loose any longer.

00:01:39.599 --> 00:01:40.867
Understood!

00:01:40.867 --> 00:01:43.436
Get me Amanda, in the Research Department.

00:01:43.436 --> 00:01:45.205
Boss, this is Amanda.

00:01:45.205 --> 00:01:46.907
How do things look there?

00:01:46.907 --> 00:01:50.010
Mei-Fong, how is Hermann?

00:01:50.010 --> 00:01:54.347
He did come in contact with an
Amalgam, so he's been quarantined.

00:01:54.347 --> 00:01:57.317
- What about his injuries?
- Lt sounds like he'll be fine.

00:01:57.317 --> 00:02:00.120
It's best to keep him locked up, though.

00:02:00.120 --> 00:02:03.556
His commitment to Gerd
isn't normal by any means.

00:02:03.556 --> 00:02:05.959
You've done enough for today. Go home.

00:02:05.959 --> 00:02:08.395
No, I have to make up
for Hermann's empty post.

00:02:08.395 --> 00:02:10.730
Getting rest is work too.

00:02:10.730 --> 00:02:13.800
Think about Malek-kun once in a while.

00:02:13.800 --> 00:02:15.368
Understood, sir.

00:02:15.368 --> 00:02:21.741
Hermann is awake.
Pulse and heart rate are normal.

00:02:21.741 --> 00:02:23.944
Now you can rest easier, Amanda.

00:02:23.944 --> 00:02:24.844
Yes.

00:02:24.844 --> 00:02:27.013
How are you feeling, Hermann?

00:02:27.013 --> 00:02:29.182
Where am I?

00:02:29.182 --> 00:02:33.053
You were really hurt, so...

00:02:33.053 --> 00:02:34.987
Hurt?

00:02:38.858 --> 00:02:41.061
What happened to the champ?! To Gerd?!

00:02:41.061 --> 00:02:43.096
We're searching for him.

00:02:43.096 --> 00:02:44.397
No, Hermann!

00:02:44.397 --> 00:02:49.232
Endure it until tomorrow.
You need to stay here for 48 hours.

00:02:51.438 --> 00:02:55.842
I see. You think I might turn into an Amalgam?

00:02:55.842 --> 00:02:58.845
You show no symptoms,
so you're probably fine.

00:02:58.845 --> 00:03:02.682
Just like when we first brought Jil Hoffman in.

00:03:02.682 --> 00:03:06.252
Not everyone who's
attacked turns into an Amalgam.

00:03:06.252 --> 00:03:08.521
Obviously!

00:03:08.521 --> 00:03:12.292
As if I'd ever become an Amalgam!

00:03:12.292 --> 00:03:16.596
You must be hungry.
I'll ask them to bring you a meal.

00:03:16.596 --> 00:03:19.690
He took Malek's letter.

00:03:27.841 --> 00:03:31.504
Gerd really is himself.

00:03:37.350 --> 00:03:39.719
...are searching via helicopter as well.

00:03:39.719 --> 00:03:45.325
Due to the danger, we ask all
citizens to refrain from going outside.

00:03:45.325 --> 00:03:50.230
And this is video from
Jil Hoffman's murder the other day.

00:03:50.230 --> 00:03:55.668
As you can see, Gerd Frentzen
is extremely dangerous now.

00:03:55.668 --> 00:04:00.440
It's the police, XAT, and guys
like them who're making Gerd suffer.

00:04:00.440 --> 00:04:05.311
Even though Gerd hasn't done anything wrong.

00:04:05.311 --> 00:04:10.984
But the champ is strong.
I'm sure he'll beat them all up.

00:04:10.984 --> 00:04:13.853
Gerd's suffering won't end that way.

00:04:13.853 --> 00:04:14.854
Why not?!

00:04:14.854 --> 00:04:17.724
Once everyone who chases him
and does bad things to him is gone...!

00:04:17.724 --> 00:04:21.561
That's where the real suffering begins.

00:04:21.561 --> 00:04:26.499
The pain of hurting others is
often worse than the pain of being hurt.

00:04:26.499 --> 00:04:30.670
Then you think he's better off being hurt?!

00:04:30.670 --> 00:04:33.468
Because he's more used to that.

00:04:36.543 --> 00:04:40.172
Gerd has probably realized it himself.

00:04:42.949 --> 00:04:47.477
The champ isn't that kind of wimp.

00:04:48.655 --> 00:04:52.421
I'll bring more food tomorrow.

00:04:56.930 --> 00:05:01.534
Sheesh. How long are you going
to keep quiet and babysit like this?

00:05:01.534 --> 00:05:06.005
Or are you the one being babysat?

00:05:06.005 --> 00:05:10.677
I'll admit, it is a perfect hideout...

00:05:10.677 --> 00:05:12.846
...but it's so unbeautiful.

00:05:12.846 --> 00:05:18.351
And are you going to let this
Gerd fellow continue to run free?

00:05:18.351 --> 00:05:22.489
Defeating him would be
playing right into Xargin's hands.

00:05:22.489 --> 00:05:28.928
Yes. But couldn't you also say
the same about leaving him alone?

00:05:28.928 --> 00:05:31.522
You have no choice!

00:06:00.326 --> 00:06:05.730
Society's full of shit! Even
the press went and turned on me!

00:06:07.634 --> 00:06:10.503
Dear Gerd Frentzen. I'm your fan.

00:06:10.503 --> 00:06:15.508
I like you a lot. You're strong
and you never lose any race.

00:06:15.508 --> 00:06:19.045
I want to be a hero, just like you...

00:06:19.045 --> 00:06:22.105
I'm no hero...

00:06:24.651 --> 00:06:26.312
I'm...!

00:06:33.393 --> 00:06:36.453
Is Malek still at school?

00:06:41.634 --> 00:06:45.171
Hello, this is Milligan,
Malek-kun's homeroom teacher.

00:06:45.171 --> 00:06:47.707
Malek-kun didn't come to
school yesterday or this morning,

00:06:47.707 --> 00:06:52.278
so I'd like to meet with you
again at the school, if at all possible.

00:06:52.278 --> 00:06:55.515
Hello, this is Milligan,
Malek-kun's homeroom teacher.

00:06:55.515 --> 00:06:59.652
Malek-kun isn't at school.
Is there any way to contact you?

00:06:59.652 --> 00:07:01.221
Malek...

00:07:01.221 --> 00:07:05.258
Hello. I'm sorry to call again.
This is Milligan, his homeroom teacher.

00:07:05.258 --> 00:07:10.930
Malek. Why haven't you been
at school? Were you lying to me?

00:07:10.930 --> 00:07:12.565
I don't need dinner.

00:07:12.565 --> 00:07:14.767
Malek! Wait!

00:07:14.767 --> 00:07:20.073
Were you bullied again?
Did you talk with the counselor?

00:07:20.073 --> 00:07:21.474
Listen, Malek.

00:07:21.474 --> 00:07:23.042
When I adopted you,

00:07:23.042 --> 00:07:27.880
I told you to be fair to everyone,
no matter where they're from.

00:07:27.880 --> 00:07:34.354
You're my little brother, so don't
let what anyone says get to you.

00:07:34.354 --> 00:07:35.588
Malek...

00:07:35.588 --> 00:07:40.159
You're from this country,
so you wouldn't understand.

00:07:40.159 --> 00:07:41.490
Malek!

00:07:45.365 --> 00:07:49.927
Why? We did so well until now...

00:08:41.788 --> 00:08:43.722
You again?!

00:09:05.845 --> 00:09:09.482
You haven't fallen yet!

00:09:09.482 --> 00:09:10.383
Yes!

00:09:10.383 --> 00:09:12.044
What?!

00:09:15.021 --> 00:09:17.455
You can't have fallen yet!

00:09:20.860 --> 00:09:22.495
Gerd Frentzen!

00:09:22.495 --> 00:09:25.498
Y-You're also...?!

00:09:25.498 --> 00:09:27.796
I'm...

00:09:29.635 --> 00:09:33.973
If you can retain your mind,
there's no need to eliminate you.

00:09:33.973 --> 00:09:36.498
Damn you!

00:09:39.612 --> 00:09:41.273
I have...

00:09:44.650 --> 00:09:46.675
...a favor to ask you...

00:09:56.596 --> 00:09:59.098
Damn. Just missed him.

00:09:59.098 --> 00:10:01.801
But why tear up a place like this?

00:10:01.801 --> 00:10:04.837
Do Amalgams need to make sense?

00:10:04.837 --> 00:10:07.840
It's as if it's been hit by a hurricane!

00:10:07.840 --> 00:10:10.743
Like a kid knocking over toy blocks,

00:10:10.743 --> 00:10:13.413
Gerd Frentzen has
destroyed this place and left!

00:10:13.413 --> 00:10:15.848
Oh! What is this?!

00:10:15.848 --> 00:10:20.553
Something has been carved here!
Was it left by Gerd Frentzen?!

00:10:20.553 --> 00:10:23.556
However, its meaning is unclear!

00:10:23.556 --> 00:10:25.558
Gerd...

00:10:25.558 --> 00:10:28.127
Open up! Let me outta here!

00:10:28.127 --> 00:10:32.461
You know I'm not gonna turn
into an Amalgam by now! Hurry up!

00:10:35.134 --> 00:10:39.730
No doubt about it! This is my
chance to return Gerd to his senses!

00:10:43.376 --> 00:10:51.078
Malek, breakfast is ready.
Can we have a leisurely talk for once?

00:11:02.929 --> 00:11:04.797
Hermann! What is it?

00:11:04.797 --> 00:11:06.966
Sorry, is Malek here?

00:11:06.966 --> 00:11:09.669
Malek! You awake?!

00:11:09.669 --> 00:11:15.942
Please, come with me! You,
if anyone, might be able to stop Gerd!

00:11:15.942 --> 00:11:20.213
When I gave your fan letter
to Gerd, his old eyes came back!

00:11:20.213 --> 00:11:23.249
Malek! Come with me to see Gerd!

00:11:23.249 --> 00:11:28.287
Hold on! You know where Gerd is?

00:11:28.287 --> 00:11:29.422
Probably.

00:11:29.422 --> 00:11:31.224
Probably?

00:11:31.224 --> 00:11:35.661
Besides, you absolutely can't
take Malek! It's too dangerous!

00:11:35.661 --> 00:11:37.597
What if something happens to him?!

00:11:37.597 --> 00:11:39.165
- Let's go.
- Malek!

00:11:39.165 --> 00:11:41.292
Be quiet, Amanda!

00:11:43.169 --> 00:11:47.006
I owe you one, Malek! Sorry, Amanda!

00:11:47.006 --> 00:11:49.474
Malek! Wait!

00:11:55.248 --> 00:11:58.284
We're gonna burn rubber. Hold on tight.

00:11:58.284 --> 00:12:01.014
- Malek!
- Malek!

00:12:04.323 --> 00:12:05.654
Umm...

00:12:06.826 --> 00:12:08.453
Johann...

00:12:16.369 --> 00:12:17.700
Gerd!

00:12:41.160 --> 00:12:44.397
Umm, where did Malek go?

00:12:44.397 --> 00:12:46.332
He went out...

00:12:46.332 --> 00:12:49.835
Say, Johann, have you
noticed anything about Malek?

00:12:49.835 --> 00:12:53.439
Like anyone bullying him a lot?

00:12:53.439 --> 00:12:55.775
Did Malek say anything?

00:12:55.775 --> 00:13:01.447
No, he won't tell me anything;
I've always been away at work.

00:13:01.447 --> 00:13:03.049
But you're his best friend...

00:13:03.049 --> 00:13:05.279
I'm not his friend!

00:13:07.286 --> 00:13:12.622
I wanted to save my own hide, so I went and...

00:13:17.129 --> 00:13:19.732
Johann?

00:13:19.732 --> 00:13:23.429
Please give this to him.
Tell him I bought a new one.

00:13:25.037 --> 00:13:29.375
I'm sorry I'm so gutless...

00:13:29.375 --> 00:13:30.967
Johann?!

00:13:43.155 --> 00:13:46.352
There! Gerd has to be there!

00:13:56.135 --> 00:13:59.605
So you did come here.

00:13:59.605 --> 00:14:02.141
Looks like you noticed it.

00:14:02.141 --> 00:14:04.343
Of course.

00:14:04.343 --> 00:14:10.349
The number 532 is the legendary
time you got on this mountain pass.

00:14:10.349 --> 00:14:16.379
5 minutes, 32 seconds, on a pass
that normally takes 6 minutes...

00:14:20.793 --> 00:14:23.996
I challenged you here many times.

00:14:23.996 --> 00:14:29.568
I could never forget this place.
It was our prime, you could say.

00:14:29.568 --> 00:14:33.172
We had a lot of fun back then.

00:14:33.172 --> 00:14:37.666
Reckless, but filled with youth and energy...

00:14:40.446 --> 00:14:44.817
Sorry, Malek. It looks like
I didn't need to bring you after all.

00:14:44.817 --> 00:14:47.386
Gerd is his old self again.

00:14:47.386 --> 00:14:50.156
Gerd, he wrote that fan letter.

00:14:50.156 --> 00:14:53.557
Oh? Thank you.

00:14:55.895 --> 00:15:01.197
C'mon, go get an autograph
or something. He's Gerd Frentzen!

00:15:04.737 --> 00:15:09.842
Champ... Please shake my hand.

00:15:09.842 --> 00:15:12.140
Please.

00:15:14.213 --> 00:15:18.851
Thanks. As a gift, I'll race for you.

00:15:18.851 --> 00:15:22.555
After turning into Amalgam,
you're the only fan who believed in me.

00:15:22.555 --> 00:15:26.859
I hope to become the
kind of hero you believe in.

00:15:26.859 --> 00:15:30.429
Hermann, let's ride, like in the old days.

00:15:30.429 --> 00:15:37.770
I'm already set. Besides,
you'll always be our hero. Always.

00:15:37.770 --> 00:15:40.102
Let's see what you got.

00:15:44.143 --> 00:15:46.112
Let's do it!

00:15:46.112 --> 00:15:48.706
One more time, like we used to...

00:15:58.958 --> 00:16:02.553
Damn! Things haven't changed at all!

00:16:03.696 --> 00:16:09.862
You really are back! Even as an
Amalgam, your heart hasn't died!

00:16:20.179 --> 00:16:21.347
You've improved!

00:16:21.347 --> 00:16:23.338
I'm just getting started!

00:16:31.724 --> 00:16:36.228
Everything I see winds
up looking like a Demoniac.

00:16:36.228 --> 00:16:40.666
I don't want to transform
into that thing ever again.

00:16:40.666 --> 00:16:44.432
You've suppressed it?

00:16:47.072 --> 00:16:49.199
That's amazing...

00:16:56.882 --> 00:16:58.440
Yes!

00:17:08.627 --> 00:17:10.629
D-Demoniac!

00:17:10.629 --> 00:17:11.664
- Where?!
- Where are you, Hermann?!

00:17:11.664 --> 00:17:14.066
What's wrong, Gerd?!

00:17:14.066 --> 00:17:15.401
You killed Hermann!

00:17:15.401 --> 00:17:17.803
Stop, Gerd! It's me! Hermann!

00:17:17.803 --> 00:17:19.794
You damn monster!

00:17:25.177 --> 00:17:26.474
Gerd!

00:17:27.913 --> 00:17:29.505
Champ...

00:17:34.520 --> 00:17:38.958
Wait... What the hell happened?!

00:17:38.958 --> 00:17:40.793
Gerd...

00:17:40.793 --> 00:17:45.397
How dare you kill Hermann! You monster!

00:17:45.397 --> 00:17:47.299
Joseph?!

00:17:47.299 --> 00:17:49.961
Stop Gerd, Joseph!

00:17:52.771 --> 00:17:56.008
Stop! Gerd Frentzen!

00:17:56.008 --> 00:17:58.110
You killed Hermann!

00:17:58.110 --> 00:18:00.846
Pull yourself together!

00:18:00.846 --> 00:18:03.007
You damn monster!

00:18:04.717 --> 00:18:08.687
What?! He's supposed
to be normal again! Gerd!

00:18:08.687 --> 00:18:12.224
Dammit! Start, you!

00:18:12.224 --> 00:18:14.660
Stop, Gerd Frentzen!

00:18:14.660 --> 00:18:16.495
You're still alive?!

00:18:16.495 --> 00:18:18.864
Stop! Champ!

00:18:18.864 --> 00:18:23.702
Another one up there?!
You monsters! I'll destroy you all!

00:18:23.702 --> 00:18:24.937
Hermann!

00:18:24.937 --> 00:18:27.039
Damn you!

00:18:27.039 --> 00:18:30.209
W-What's going on? Champ?

00:18:30.209 --> 00:18:33.610
You killed Hermann!

00:18:38.017 --> 00:18:40.315
Above?! Malek's in danger!

00:18:42.688 --> 00:18:46.954
Run, Malek! Your feelings
won't reach Gerd as he is now!

00:18:48.060 --> 00:18:51.764
You monster!

00:18:51.764 --> 00:18:53.356
Stop!

00:18:55.601 --> 00:18:58.263
Die!

00:19:02.107 --> 00:19:09.515
If I ever wind up in that form
again and try to attack someone...

00:19:09.515 --> 00:19:11.517
...get rid of me...

00:19:11.517 --> 00:19:16.921
But... I want to race with
my good friend one last time...

00:19:23.362 --> 00:19:25.464
Gerd! Malek!

00:19:25.464 --> 00:19:28.667
Stop, Champ!

00:19:28.667 --> 00:19:29.902
Gerd Frentzen!

00:19:29.902 --> 00:19:32.530
You damn monsters!

00:19:38.010 --> 00:19:40.179
That's...!

00:19:40.179 --> 00:19:42.715
Dammit! Stop, Gerd!

00:19:42.715 --> 00:19:46.515
Gerd! Gerd!

00:19:47.987 --> 00:19:52.651
Please... end me!

00:20:06.105 --> 00:20:10.974
Damn you! Don't kill him!

00:20:19.752 --> 00:20:21.549
Gerd!

00:20:23.088 --> 00:20:25.824
Don't die, Gerd!

00:20:25.824 --> 00:20:27.485
Hermann...

00:20:30.195 --> 00:20:34.996
That was a great race...

00:20:44.109 --> 00:20:46.445
Gerd?

00:20:46.445 --> 00:20:49.615
Hey! Gerd! Don't go!

00:20:49.615 --> 00:20:54.720
Gerd... Gerd...

00:20:54.720 --> 00:20:59.589
Gerd!

00:21:03.729 --> 00:21:05.731
He's a liar...

00:21:05.731 --> 00:21:11.567
He's no hero. He's a spineless wimp...

00:21:22.081 --> 00:21:28.384
Gerd!

00:21:47.039 --> 00:21:54.913
The ever-flowing songs search my memory

00:21:54.913 --> 00:22:07.025
The pain etched out by the
times slowly brings me back

00:22:07.025 --> 00:22:10.262
Embrace the sadness

00:22:10.262 --> 00:22:17.703
I know, the days that have passed by

00:22:17.703 --> 00:22:22.207
When I look up, it doesn't spill down

00:22:22.207 --> 00:22:28.780
As it trickles down the window,
sad rain rattles the heated isolation

00:22:28.780 --> 00:22:34.153
Tonight I will be forsaken by sleep

00:22:34.153 --> 00:22:41.960
It's almost as if I'm traveling
to a country no one's ever heard of

00:22:41.960 --> 00:22:48.300
I'm all alone, and my words
don't get through to anyone

00:22:48.300 --> 00:22:50.369
Wow wow

00:22:50.369 --> 00:22:58.377
Now my heart is frozen and waiting

00:22:58.377 --> 00:23:05.476
because it wants a phone
call so it can connect with you

00:23:13.325 --> 00:23:16.995
Unpunished sin. Unrequited grief.

00:23:16.995 --> 00:23:22.034
What if it's the Devil who
hears that anger, and not God?

00:23:22.034 --> 00:23:25.904
Episode 7: "At the Ends of Hatred."

00:23:25.904 --> 00:23:30.204
Who will wipe away the
tears of the downtrodden?
